cleshow/135611697.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-06T20:43:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aastha Jha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135612392,imgsize-80728.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[PM Modi's Sule message to Sharad Pawar; 'internal tussle' in NCP: Is Maharashtra politics heading for another churn?]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/pm-modis-sule-message-to-sharad-pawar-tussle-in-ncp-is-maharashtra-politics-heading-for-another-churn/articleshow/135610491.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135610491.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Internal conflicts within the Pawar clan has once again put the party at a crossroads. A meeting of senior NCP leaders with Union home minister Amit Shah amid reports of discontent within the party has fuelled speculations. NCP chief Sunetra Pawar has convened meetings to address unity concerns after Ajit Pawar's death. Rohit Pawar has issued a caution to the family regaridng possible BJP manoeuvres.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/pm-modis-sule-message-to-sharad-pawar-tussle-in-ncp-is-maharashtra-politics-heading-for-another-churn/articleshow/135610491.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/pm-modis-sule-message-to-sharad-pawar-tussle-in-ncp-is-maharashtra-politics-heading-for-another-churn/articleshow/135610491.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-06T20:32:35+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Kunal Varma</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135612828,imgsize-90300.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Directed at Delhi govt officials': Court dismisses plea seeking FIR against CM Rekha Gupta over Lord Hanuman remark]]></title><description><![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/directed-at-delhi-govt-officials-court-dismisses-plea-seeking-fir-against-rekha-gupta-over-hanuman-remark/articleshow/135609967.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/directed-at-delhi-govt-officials-court-dismisses-plea-seeking-fir-against-rekha-gupta-over-hanuman-remark/articleshow/135609967.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-06T20:08:53+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Karan Manral</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135611871,imgsize-87434.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Living near a highway toll plaza? New FASTag rule offers annual pass of up to Rs 3,000, but there's a catch]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/living-near-a-highway-toll-plaza-new-fastag-rule-offers-annual-pass-of-up-to-rs-3000-but-theres-a-catch/articleshow/135609104.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135609104.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Residents living within 20 km of National Highway toll plazas can apply for a Concessional Local Pass. The pass costs Rs 1,500 or Rs 3,000 annually, depending on the plaza's location. To qualify, motorists must have a functional FASTag, and their vehicle must be non-commercial. The scheme aims to reduce toll expenses for eligible residents but has specific restrictions.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/living-near-a-highway-toll-plaza-new-fastag-rule-offers-annual-pass-of-up-to-rs-3000-but-theres-a-catch/articleshow/135609104.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/living-near-a-highway-toll-plaza-new-fastag-rule-offers-annual-pass-of-up-to-rs-3000-but-theres-a-catch/articleshow/135609104.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-06T19:17:17+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pranjal Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135610133,imgsize-120424.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Evening Newswrap: Panic as Karmabhoomi Express catches fire in Punjab; bomb threats to Bombay HC, BSE and Amitabh Bachchan’s residence, and more]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/evening-newswrap-panic-as-karmabhoomi-express-catches-fire-in-punjab-bomb-threats-to-bombay-hc-bse-and-amitabh-bachchans-residence-and-more/articleshow/135607625.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135607625.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/evening-newswrap-panic-as-karmabhoomi-express-catches-fire-in-punjab-bomb-threats-to-bombay-hc-bse-and-amitabh-bachchans-residence-and-more/articleshow/135607625.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/evening-newswrap-panic-as-karmabhoomi-express-catches-fire-in-punjab-bomb-threats-to-bombay-hc-bse-and-amitabh-bachchans-residence-and-more/articleshow/135607625.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-06T18:36:53+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pranjal Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135608859,imgsize-1454451.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Your tacit approval?' BJP chief Nitin Nabin questions Rahul Gandhi over Jharkhand Congress leader's 'Nepal-Bangladesh' remark]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/your-tacit-approval-bjp-chief-nitin-nabin-questions-rahul-gandhi-over-jharkhand-congress-leaders-nepal-bangladesh-remark/articleshow/135608490.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135608490.cms" /&gt;&